  "limitations": [
    "Paired same-round bootstrap estimates median(candidate) - median(baseline), 5000 fixed-seed resamples, percentile 95% interval; no significance conclusion.",
    "These samples isolate component variants in a core-import-only workload. They do not independently certify lifecycle behavior.",
